  <item>
    <title>11月新歌，感受精彩的戴佩妮、陈婧霏、The Cure...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674b4aa80ed328720a8550fb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674b4aa80ed328720a8550fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>11月新歌分享，11月里气温在逐步降低，但好听的歌曲数是在逐步上升，耳朵也得到了保暖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不得不说年底真的好精彩，特别是华语专辑，有些没有预告就直接发布了，所以这一期的新歌分享也是多分享了几首，希望你们会喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎧本期歌曲（歌曲 - 专辑 - 音乐人）：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 远距离 - 双生火焰 - 戴佩妮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> We Could Be Shy 内向的人 - Queen and Elf - 喜辰晨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> 与生俱来的爱 (feat. 苏珮卿) - 好好的 - 柯泯薰</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 自恋咒 - 猩红 - 陈婧霏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> Evil Gemini - DAZE - Everydaze</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> Blue Dream Pt.2 ft. Flashdaddy - Pineapple Bun 2 - 国蛋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1743">29:03</a> OH I THOUGHT THAT WE CARED - 罐头塔 - 陈以恒</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> 草芥的歌谣 - 月下世界 - 天鹅与花朵</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">39:14</a> 赶早 - Bu Xiang - 梯云纵</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> And Nothing Is Forever - Songs Of A Lost World - The Cure</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a> Nothings Promised - The Crossroads - Cordae</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3396">56:36</a> Pieces Of You - Petrichor - 070 Shake</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> Mahashmashana - Mahashmashana - Father John Misty</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">60:10</a> &nbsp;미카엘（Mikael）- 천사 인터뷰(Angel interview) - 김뜻돌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3615">60:15</a> D - 30.5 - 다섯（Dasutt）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3622">60:22</a> Womb - Midnight - Mouse On The Keys</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>主播/制作/剪辑：</span></strong><span>飞特</span></p><span></span><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
