    <guid isPermaLink="false">6726476833c798676fee87a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Nov 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>10月新歌分享，这个月好听的歌曲不断涌出，耳朵都是忙碌且享受的状态，让这个秋日多了些缤纷跳动的色彩，感受到多样的氛围。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目依旧会分享一些我在10月听过的音乐，希望有你喜欢的歌曲，一起听听10月里的新歌吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期歌曲（歌曲 - 专辑 -音乐人）：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 没啥好说 - 梦想家 The Dreamer - 方大同</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 催眠 = 爱 Hypnotize - Shhh, It’s Under My Bed - Andr</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a> 贝比（BABY）- Dance On The Shoreline - LÜCY</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 绿洲 - ME? - Matt吕彦良</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> Holding Water - Holding Water - Ash紫煊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a> Path Of Life - Sphere Sphere - baibaimai</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a> 飞翔 muvii - 靠近 mudalrep - 桑布伊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 去北戴河 - Cliche - Sleeping Dogs</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a> Take The Mask Off - CHROMAKOPIA - Tyler, The Creator</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2519">41:59</a> Holy, Holy - The New Sound - Geordie Greep</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">48:38</a> Anybody - Clouds In The Sky They Will Always Be There For me - Porridge Radio</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3191">53:11</a> Losing Side Of Love - Got A Story To Tell - Thee Sacred Souls</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3382">56:22</a> Child Of Mine - Patterns In Repeat - Laura Marling</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">60:02</a> Float On Baby - Wah!!! - Chinese American Bear</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">60:06</a> Strawberry Picking - Pathway - She Her Her Hers</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>主播/制作/剪辑：</span></strong><span>飞特</span></p><span></span><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
