  <item>
    <title>完美的日子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671dd51f44ae79002c560cda</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671dd51f44ae79002c560cda</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 05:52:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目要分享的是电影完美的日子里面的歌曲。</span></p><p><span>再次看完电影完美的日子后还是给我平静的感受，除了电影本身之外，里面的配乐同样很吸引我，每一首音乐的选择都很符合电影场景的设定。</span></p><p><span>一起听听这些配乐，从歌曲感受下电影的场景吧！</span></p><p><strong><span>本期歌曲：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> House Of The Rising Sun - The Animals</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpD4VuqvqwlzcfEQ5LJoZhSN8Pw0.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a> Pale Blue Eyes - The Velvet Underground</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxY4r_szf50y6ZeMlbMDCpOOnw3.jpg"></figure><p><span>地下丝绒著名的专辑封面</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsdL_BiD5baWh70OCng9k9GfEfIY.webp"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> (Sittin' On) The Dock Of The Bay - Otis Redding</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNCzdcKpqaneBYcknyp8q7Xfg0y.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> Redondo Beach - Patti Smith</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fna8U6TYbjUh4-HQD_D3U6R_SKiw.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> (Walkin' Thru' The) Sleepy City - The Rolling Stones</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi67HN_rpibH-A4oZXHHjHINKh4o.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 青い魚 - 金延幸子</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLWi1PoWG5T8sMRpHYhawdXh76V.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">27:01</a> Perfect Day - Lou Reed</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnY6RKiME-jnx4ZPN4nOarWwUXEp.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a> Sunny Afternoon - The Kinks</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjAYEYZCGJNbS5_BcYEAaaHt5njG.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> Brown Eyed Girl - Van Morrison</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFTpRGfYtwujG6_JvcDk345gi4k.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2298">38:18</a> Feeling Good - Nina Simone</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFr4N9YpC6SHPVi1H9avTtWUOsP.jpg"></figure><p><span>尽力像电影里面的主人公一样，在当下的日子和生活中去感受美好，有喜欢喝的饮料咖啡，有喜欢去的小店，有喜欢看的书，有喜欢听的歌</span></p><p><strong><span>主播/制作/剪辑：</span></strong><span>飞特</span></p><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
