    <itunes:duration>00:41:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpU2GR_XXB4Gg9MpH9kDdwxEgVoA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>天凉好个秋，听着饶舌Chill</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6714b4c8db2cf8275785fb5e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6714b4c8db2cf8275785fb5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Oct 2024 07:44:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍂身在南方的我最近终于在早晨的空气里感受到了秋天的气息，喜欢的季节来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天跟夏天是很不同的，夏天是那种活泼欢快的氛围，而在秋天，给我的感受更多的是需要一种从容镇定、松弛慵懒，把这些感觉体现到歌曲上，我觉得chill一些的饶舌，会蛮符合这样的需求。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目，也是在这个方向上，选的饶舌歌曲会以听起来比较chill，身体可能会不自觉跟着摇摆或者头也会不自觉跟着点的，一起开始秋日chill之旅吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期歌曲：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 一起松 Chill With It - 參劈TriPoets / 白天不亮 / 14?</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> Hit The Rhyme - 蛋堡</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> Diary Freestyle Pt.2 - 国蛋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1019">16:59</a> 地下摇摆 - Juzzy Orange</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 轻松帅 - 许时ShiShr</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> COZY - Chelmico</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a> RELAXIN' - やけのはら（Yakenohara）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> Cats &amp; Dogs (feat. カネコアヤノ) - KID FRESINO / カネコアヤノ</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> Close To You - Jazzyfact</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> No Time To Play - Guru</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> Night To Remember - The Sound Providers / Surreal</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>秋天开始气温会慢慢变冷，在chill的同时也需要律动的节奏来帮助身体和情绪升升温，希望这期节目能让你有这样的感受！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播/制作/剪辑：</span></strong><span>飞特</span></p><span></span><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnALtioeTdrU3_y6pt5f2SEB6bjo.m4a" length="80398860" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjfhn8_ai7zqZPHqpJQLHrPYXxxY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>东南亚里热烈浪漫的泰国音乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670bb983db2cf82757dfc9e4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670bb983db2cf82757dfc9e4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Oct 2024 12:13:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>假期去了清迈一趟，旅途里耳机会放一些泰国音乐人的歌曲，想起听到这些音乐之前，对东南亚特别是泰国音乐的印象会觉得比较奇怪魔性，但后续接触多了，才知道其实泰国音乐并不全是这样，除了这部分之外，有很多也是很丰富很好听的，甚至觉得泰语也蛮适合唱情歌</span></p><p><span>这期节目会分享我听过的一部分泰国音乐人的作品，希望也能让大家感受到泰国音乐的丰富好听！</span></p><p><strong><span>本期歌曲</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>YONLAPA</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> U</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> Let Me Go</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>LoserPop</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> เคย（曾经）</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> ช่อดอกไม้ (Scent)</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>Rosalyn</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 20: 37</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">24:03</a> She Was Hot</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>Chucky Factory Land</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1747">29:07</a> HOTYE</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> QUIT IN BLISS</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>Soft Pine</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> I Thought I Could Be Alone</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2394">39:54</a> Afternoon Shroom</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>Door Plant</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2606">43:26</a> I‘m Saying, Love You</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> Plum</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>Temp.</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> Miss Summer</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3467">57:47</a> Ring Ring</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>YENTED</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">60:01</a> พูดไปเหอะ（说吧）</span></p></li></ul><p><span>泰国大部分的时间是夏天的日子，在这样热情的日子里面，或许会期待着些什么事情发生，也希望大家期待的事情能如愿发生！</span></p><p><strong><span>主播/制作/剪辑：</span></strong><span>飞特</span></p><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu1DlM6uWPEuW5eRe05xcQlNuSqB.m4a" length="96285847" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpc7TmAAVYfa5hfaIDLemiTBFB4s.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>9月新歌，假期前听听窦靖童、FunkyMo、Nilüfer Yanya...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f6e4256c7f817786966055</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f6e4256c7f817786966055</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Sep 2024 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
