  <item>
    <title>用灵魂乐找找灵魂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c1c2a2db5e6d6bf92045a6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c1c2a2db5e6d6bf92045a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Aug 2024 09:45:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>灵魂乐（Soul Music），是1950年代发源自美国的一种结合了节奏蓝调和福音音乐的音乐流派。紧扣节奏、拍掌和即兴的形体动作。而新灵魂乐（Neo Soul）则是在传统灵魂乐的基础上融合了其他多种音乐元素，例如Funk、Jazz等等的音乐风格</span></p><span></span><p><span>灵魂乐充满情感，发自内心的演唱总是能直击我的心灵，对我来说，听灵魂乐也是一种疗愈方式，所以灵魂乐在我的歌单中也是不可或缺的</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，我会分享一些灵魂乐以及新灵魂乐的音乐，同时也会简单聊一下这类音乐的风格，希望你们会喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期歌曲（歌曲 - 音乐人）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> I Say A Little Prayer - Aretha Franklin</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> A Change Is Gonna Come - Sam Cooke</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> My Cherie Amour - Stevie Wonder</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> Under The Boardwalk - The Drifters</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> Let's Stay Together - AI Green</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> Bad Habits - Maxwell</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> Apple Tree - Erykah Badu</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> Half Crazy - Musiq Soulchild</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> Mama Knew Love - Anthony Hamilton</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> Say Yes - Floetry</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a> Give Me the Night - George Benson</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播/制作/剪辑：</span></strong><span>飞特</span></p><span></span><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
