    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听第5期节目。在上一期的乐队歌单分享中有提到会继续分享乐队，这期就来啦，不过这次将目标转向了其他地方，分享一些日本乐队，日本乐队同样有着他独特的魅力，风格多元也极具感染力，所以也值得去聆听感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天分享的乐队有摇滚、迷幻、电子也有流行，希望有你喜欢的乐队或者歌曲，一起感受不一样的音乐魅力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期歌曲（歌曲 - 专辑）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Ogre You Asshole</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> コインランドリー - アルファベータ vs. ラムダ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 夜の船 - 100年後</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>No Buses</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a> Pretty Old Man - Boys Missed The Bus</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> Dirty Feeling - Boys Loved Her</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Tempalay</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a> 革命前夜 - from JAPAN 2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> そなちね - 21世紀より愛をこめて</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Sunny Day Service</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> 春の風 - いいね！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> One Day - Sunny</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>South Penguin</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> Ame - alaska</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2414">40:14</a> Collage - house</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Ego Apartment</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2798">46:38</a> Wrong With You - EGO APARTMENT</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> Pools - ku ru i</span></p><span></span><p><span>后续还会继续更新乐队歌单，如果有喜欢的欢迎订阅关注不要错过</span></p><span></span><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
