    <title>夏日City Pop：感受音乐里的夏日氛围</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6693b3988fcadceb9036eb3a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6693b3988fcadceb9036eb3a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jul 2024 11:16:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听着City Pop总能有这样的画面：大海、沙滩、棕榈树、泳池、游泳冲浪、落日余晖，或者开着车行驶在海滨公路上，又或者穿梭在霓虹都市中等等，同时也会呈现出欢快浪漫的气氛，让人非常开心放松，而这一切，刚好就很适合现在炎热的夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这期节目，就想在这个夏日分享一些City Pop的歌曲，同时也会简单介绍下City Pop以及音乐人，让我们一起感受这些氛围吧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴（歌曲 - 专辑 - 音乐人）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> DAYDREAM - Ride On Time - 山下達郎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> DON'T STOP THE MUSIC - ハートはLAマインド &nbsp;(Heart Full Of L.A. Mind) - 当山瞳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> Shiny Lady - This Boy - 佐藤博</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> Ocean Side - OCEAN SIDE - 菊池桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> My Sweet Lady - Again - 黒住憲五</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a> Weekend Love - Relief 72 hours - 国分友里恵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> One Hot Love - First Light - 松下誠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a> Pacific - Romantic Guys - 芳野藤丸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> クルージング・オン(CRUSING ON) - Monday Morning - ブレッド&amp;バター(BREAD &amp; BUTTER)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> Summer Breeze - SUMMER BREEZE - パイパー(Piper)</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家有好听的City Pop歌曲也非常欢迎在评论区分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>《飞行耳机》是一档分享音乐的播客节目，听听耳机里面的音乐，欢迎大家订阅关注后续节目</span></p>]]></description>
